      "source": [
        "# ESA Ground Station Scheduling Pipeline\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook develops the ground-station scheduling pipeline after realistic data generation. The realistic data pipeline in `satellite-antenna-data` now handles real satellite/gateway loading, visibility-window generation, operational enrichment, and candidate-slot discretization.\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook starts from the Layer E candidate-slot CSV, creates the existing `GroundStation`, `Satellite`, `Antenna`, and `CandidateSlot` adapter objects, then continues with the original optimization stages: safe reductions, optional top-k filtering, conflict graph construction, MWIS solving, QUBO construction, subproblem selection, and annealing experiments."
      ]
    },
