      "source": [
        "## Phase 4: First Heuristic Reduction\n",
        "\n",
        "This phase adds the first heuristic reduction: **top-k per satellite**. Unlike the Phase 3 reductions, this step is not guaranteed to preserve the exact optimum. It is useful when a benchmark instance is too large and we want a controlled way to keep only the strongest candidate slots for each satellite.\n",
        "\n",
        "The heuristic is applied only when explicitly requested."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "8140ef35",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Top-k Per Satellite\n",
        "\n",
        "The function groups slots by satellite, sorts each group by descending weight, and keeps the first `k` slots per satellite. Ties are broken by earlier start time and then by slot id for deterministic output."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 261,
      "id": "37d8db27",
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def keep_top_k_per_satellite(slots: list[CandidateSlot], k: int) -> tuple[list[CandidateSlot], list[Dict[str, str]]]:\n",
        "    \"\"\"Keep at most the top `k` candidate slots for each satellite.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Slots are ranked within each satellite by descending weight. Earlier start\n",
        "    time and slot id are used as deterministic tie breakers.\n",
        "    \"\"\"\n",
        "    if k <= 0:\n",
        "        raise ValueError(\"k must be a positive integer.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "    slots_by_satellite = {}\n",
        "    for slot in slots:\n",
        "        slots_by_satellite.setdefault(slot.satellite_id, []).append(slot)\n",
        "\n",
        "    kept_slots = []\n",
        "    removed_slots = []\n",
        "\n",
        "    for satellite_id in sorted(slots_by_satellite):\n",
        "        satellite_slots = slots_by_satellite[satellite_id]\n",
        "        ranked_slots = sorted(\n",
        "            satellite_slots,\n",
        "            key=lambda slot: (-slot.weight, slot.start_time, slot.slot_id),\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "        kept_slots.extend(ranked_slots[:k])\n",
        "        for removed_slot in ranked_slots[k:]:\n",
        "            removed_slots.append(\n",
        "                {\n",
        "                    \"slot_id\": removed_slot.slot_id,\n",
        "                    \"satellite_id\": removed_slot.satellite_id,\n",
        "                    \"reason\": f\"outside top {k} for satellite {removed_slot.satellite_id}\",\n",
        "                }\n",
        "            )\n",
        "\n",
        "    return kept_slots, removed_slots\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def run_reduction_pipeline_with_optional_top_k(\n",
        "    slots: list[CandidateSlot],\n",
        "    horizon_start: float,\n",
        "    horizon_end: float,\n",
        "    antenna_availability: Dict[str, tuple[float, float]],\n",
        "    blackout_intervals: list[tuple[float, float]],\n",
        "    min_duration: float,\n",
        "    max_duration: float | None = None,\n",
        "    fixed_contacts: list[CandidateSlot] | None = None,\n",
        "    top_k_per_satellite: int | None = None,\n",
        ") -> tuple[list[CandidateSlot], Dict[str, object]]:\n",
        "    \"\"\"Run safe reductions and optionally apply top-k per satellite.\"\"\"\n",
        "    reduced_slots, report = run_safe_reduction_pipeline(\n",
        "        slots=slots,\n",
        "        horizon_start=horizon_start,\n",
        "        horizon_end=horizon_end,\n",
        "        antenna_availability=antenna_availability,\n",
        "        blackout_intervals=blackout_intervals,\n",
        "        min_duration=min_duration,\n",
        "        max_duration=max_duration,\n",
        "        fixed_contacts=fixed_contacts,\n",
        "        )\n",
        "\n",
        "    report[\"top_k_per_satellite\"] = top_k_per_satellite\n",
        "    report[\"top_k_removals\"] = []\n",
        "\n",
        "    if top_k_per_satellite is not None:\n",
        "        reduced_slots, top_k_removals = keep_top_k_per_satellite(\n",
        "            slots=reduced_slots,\n",
        "            k=top_k_per_satellite,\n",
        "        )\n",
        "        report[\"top_k_removals\"] = top_k_removals\n",
        "\n",
        "    report[\"after_optional_top_k_size\"] = len(reduced_slots)\n",
        "    return reduced_slots, report\n"
      ]
    },
